[00:00.68]Lesson 47 | 第47课
[00:03.19]A cup of coffee | 一杯咖啡
[00:06.27]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.16]How does Ann like her coffee? | 安喜欢怎么喝咖啡?
[00:17.15]Do you like coffee, Ann? | 安,你喜欢咖啡吗?
[00:20.61]Yes, I do. | 是的,喜欢。
[00:23.43]Do you want a cup? | 你想来一杯吗?
[00:26.40]Yes, please, Christine. | 好的,谢谢,克里斯廷。
[00:30.36]Do you want any sugar? | 你要加些糖吗?
[00:33.58]Yes, please. | 好的,谢谢。
[00:36.05]Do you want any milk? | 你要加些牛奶吗?
[00:39.18]No, thank you. | 不,谢谢。
[00:40.92]I don't like milk in my coffee. | 我不喜欢咖啡里加牛奶。
[00:44.56]I like black coffee. | 我喜欢清咖啡。
[00:48.41]Do you like biscuits? | 你喜欢饼干吗?
[00:51.33]Yes, I do. | 是的,喜欢。
[00:53.88]Do you want one? | 你要来一块吗?
[00:56.02]Yes, please. | 好的,谢谢。